<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>我们的情侣纪念站</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:"Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffb6c1,#ffcccc,#f8c8dc);min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden}
.wrap{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
.header{text-align:center;padding:55px 0 30px;color:#fff}
.header h1{font-size:27px;margin-bottom:10px}
.time{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:28px}
.card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);border-radius:18px;padding:25px;margin-bottom:22px}
.card h2{font-size:21px;color:#ff5a7a;margin-bottom:14px}
.card p{line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;color:#333}
.footer{text-align:center;padding:35px 0;color:#fff;font-size:14px}
.heart{position:fixed;pointer-events:none;color:#ff8da1;font-size:16px;animation:fall linear forwards}
@keyframes fall{0%{transform:translateY(-10vh) rotate(0deg);opacity:.8}100%{transform:translateY(100vh) rotate(360deg);opacity:0}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>执子之手-与子偕老</h1>
    <p>我们的专属小世界</p>
  </div>

  <div class="time">
    相遇时光：<span id="timer"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>关于我们</h2>
    <p>二零二三年正月初一，我们的故事正式开始。人海茫茫，有幸相遇，温柔是你，欢喜是你，往后余生，万般皆你。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>往后余生</h2>
    <p>小瓶子会一直陪着章鱼，岁岁年年，朝朝暮暮，三餐四季，永不缺席。所有温柔与偏爱，都只属于你。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    🫙小瓶子 ❤️ 🐙章鱼 · 永远在一起
  </div>
</div>

<script>
const start = new Date("2023-01-22 00:00:00").getTime();
function update(){
  const now = Date.now();
  const diff = now - start;
  const d = Math.floor(diff / 86400000);
  const h = Math.floor((diff % 86400000) / 3600000);
  const m = Math.floor((diff % 3600000) / 60000);
  const s = Math.floor((diff % 60000) / 1000);
  document.getElementById("timer").innerText = d+"天 "+h+"时 "+m+"分 "+s+"秒";
}
setInterval(update,1000);update();

function createHeart(){
  const h = document.createElement("div");
  h.className="heart";
  h.innerText="💘";
  h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
  h.style.animationDuration=(Math.random()*4+5)+"s";
  document.body.appendChild(h);
  setTimeout(()=>h.remove(),8000);
}
setInterval(createHeart,350);
</script>
</body>
</html>
